{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BraidsAndKnots.RMatrixBraidingStructure","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BraidsAndKnots.RMatrixBraidingStructure","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.su2_fundamental_r_matrix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.su2_fundamental_r_matrix","kind":"def","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L131-L146","doc":"For the fundamental representation of `SU_q(2)`, the R-matrix has\neigenvalues `q` and `-q⁻¹`; their sum is `q - q⁻¹` and their product is\n`-1` (so `σ² = (q - q⁻¹)σ + 1`, the Hecke relation). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.hecke_prod_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.hecke_prod_eq","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L129-L129","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.hecke_sum_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.hecke_sum_eq","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L128-L128","doc":"Characteristic-polynomial coefficient witnesses (`σ² = hecke_sum·σ - hecke_prod`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.hecke_prod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.hecke_prod","kind":"def","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L126-L126","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.hecke_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.hecke_sum","kind":"def","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L125-L125","doc":"The Hecke relation in eigenvalue form: the sum of eigenvalues equals\n`q - q⁻¹` and their product equals `-1`, equivalently\n`eᵢ_sym + eᵢ_anti = (eᵢ_sym · eᵢ_anti) · (-1)`… recorded here as the\ntwo coefficient identities of the characteristic polynomial. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.eigenvalue_antisymmetric","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.eigenvalue_antisymmetric","kind":"def","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L120-L120","doc":"Antisymmetric-channel eigenvalue (`= -q⁻¹`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.eigenvalue_symmetric","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.eigenvalue_symmetric","kind":"def","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L118-L118","doc":"Symmetric-channel eigenvalue (`= q`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.repDim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.repDim","kind":"def","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L116-L116","doc":"Dimension of the representation (fundamental of `SU_q(2)`: dim = 2). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L114-L114","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.RMatrixEigenData","kind":"structure","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L109-L129","doc":"The R-matrix eigenvalue data on the fundamental of `SU_q(2)`:\n`q` on the symmetric channel and `-q⁻¹` on the antisymmetric channel,\nsatisfying the Hecke relation `(σ - q)(σ + q⁻¹) = 0`, i.e.\n`σ² = (q - q⁻¹)σ + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.braid_rep_from_R_check","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.braid_rep_from_R_check","kind":"def","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L102-L107","doc":"Alias for the braid-relation half, kept because the manuscript refers to the\nbraid-group representation separately from the Yang–Baxter equation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.r_matrix_braiding_structure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.r_matrix_braiding_structure","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L87-L100","doc":"**The claim of `prop:r-matrix-braiding-structure`**: for the universal\n`R`-matrix of `U_q(𝔰𝔲(2))` and its braid operator `Ř = P ∘ R`, the Yang–Baxter\nequation and the braid relation both hold.\n\nStated here as a named proposition over an arbitrary system, **not asserted**.\nEstablishing it for Drinfeld's `R`-matrix is standard and cited; constructing\nthat `R`-matrix is not done in this development, so no declaration here claims\nit. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:r-matrix-braiding-structure","label":"prop:r-matrix-braiding-structure","md":"quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidRelationHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidRelationHolds","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L79-L85","doc":"**Braid relation** `Ř₁ Ř₂ Ř₁ = Ř₂ Ř₁ Ř₂` for `Ř = P ∘ R`, as a proposition\nabout caller-supplied braid operators.  This is what makes `σ_i ↦ Ř_i` extend to\na braid-group representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.YangBaxterHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.YangBaxterHolds","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L73-L77","doc":"**Yang–Baxter equation** `R₁₂ ∘ R₁₃ ∘ R₂₃ = R₂₃ ∘ R₁₃ ∘ R₁₂`, as a\nproposition about a caller-supplied triple of `R`-matrix actions. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.q_inv_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.q_inv_param","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L40-L40","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.q_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.q_param","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L39-L39","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.R_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.R_q","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/r-matrix-braiding-structure.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0}]}